From 4edb8c9d520abfb837b1d47934dff223b370d807 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 16:14:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(skills): document only wired flags (drop dead
 --reason/--json/--no-master-sync)

Round-5 (Codex): the skills documented CLI flags that silently no-op. Verified
via full dispatch trace: bin/forge.js parseFlags() has a fixed allowlist and
drops unknown flags (else{i++}), and the registry passes that object to handlers
(bin/forge.js:4122). So gate.js flags.reason/flags.json and clean.js
flags['--no-master-sync'] are never populated.
- gates/SKILL.md: drop --reason from approve/reject and --json from status
- worktree/SKILL.md: drop 'forge clean --no-master-sync'
- kept forms verified wired: worktree create --issue/--branch/--base/--work-folder
  (worktree.js self-parses), forge control status --json (control.js args
  fallback), --dry-run/--force (in allowlist)
- CLI parsing gap filed as 07c3daf6; re-add these flags once it lands
- regen worktree scorecard; .agents synced by hook

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
